 : la box beauté bio made in France la plus plébiscitée. 6 produits certifiés bio, valeur 80€+, à partir de 25€/mois. Offre découverte sans engagement disponible.\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"style\":{\"margin\":\"40px 0\",\"padding\":\"24px\",\"background\":\"var(--muted, #f3f4f6)\",\"borderRadius\":\"16px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"12px\"},\"children\":\"Explorer par catégorie\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"gap\":\"8px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"test-gratuit\",{\"href\":\"/categorie/test-gratuit\",\"style\":{\"padding\":\"6px 14px\",\"borderRadius\":\"999px\",\"background\":\"white\",\"fontSize\":\"0.82rem\",\"color\":\"var(--text, #374151)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"border\":\"1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb)\"},\"children\":[\"🎁\",\" \",\"Tests Gratuits\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"concours\",{\"href\":\"/categorie/concours\",\"style\":{\"padding\":\"6px 14px\",\"borderRadius\":\"999px\",\"background\":\"white\",\"fontSize\":\"0.82rem\",\"color\":\"var(--text, #374151)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"border\":\"1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb)\"},\"children\":[\"🏆\",\" \",\"Concours\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"box-beaute\",{\"href\":\"/categorie/box-beaute\",\"style\":{\"padding\":\"6px 14px\",\"borderRadius\":\"999px\",\"background\":\"white\",\"fontSize\":\"0.82rem\",\"color\":\"var(--text, #374151)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"border\":\"1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb)\"},\"children\":[\"💄\",\" \",\"Box Beauté\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"code-promo\",{\"href\":\"/categorie/code-promo\",\"style\":{\"padding\":\"6px 14px\",\"borderRadius\":\"999px\",\"background\":\"white\",\"fontSize\":\"0.82rem\",\"color\":\"var(--text, #374151)\",\"textDecoration\":\"none\",\"fontWeight\":500,\"border\":\"1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb)\"},\"children\":[\"🎟️\",\" \",\"Codes Promo\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"beaut